  "title": "etwdump: add ProcessorNumber to packet comments",
  "description": "Adds the 'ProcessorNumber' field to etwdump parsed ETL captures. The 'ProcessorNumber' is used to correlate packets with ETW events emitted for that packet when there are many packets being processed simultaneously across cores.",
